(BrailleAir Project Report) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Project name: BrailleAir) Tj
T*
(Report date: 11 April 2026) Tj
T*
(Report style: Simple English) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. Project Summary) Tj
T*
(BrailleAir is an assistive technology project. It takes an image of printed text,) Tj
T*
(reads the text with OCR, changes the text into Tamil, converts the result into a) Tj
T*
(Braille-like 5-bit vibration pattern, and then sends or simulates vibration commands) Tj
T*
(for a tactile device. The project also includes a web API and a React frontend.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(2. What The Project Uses) Tj
T*
(- Python backend) Tj
T*
(- LangGraph state pipeline) Tj
T*
(- OpenCV for image preprocessing) Tj
T*
(- Tesseract OCR for English and Tamil text reading) Tj
T*
(- Langdetect for language detection) Tj
T*
(- googletrans for online translation when available) Tj
T*
(- Local fallback dictionary for offline translation) Tj
T*
(- Gemini LLM integration through google.generativeai) Tj
T*
(- Bleak for Bluetooth Low Energy support) Tj
T*
(- FastAPI backend) Tj
T*
(- React, Vite, Axios, Framer Motion, and Lucide React frontend) Tj
T*
(- Pytest for tests) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(3. Main Working Flow) Tj
T*
(Step 1: Capture image from file, webcam, or planned BLE source.) Tj
T*
(Step 2: Preprocess image with grayscale, denoise, deskew, threshold, and resize.) Tj
T*
(Step 3: OCR reads the text.) Tj
T*
(Step 4: Retry OCR if the first result is empty.) Tj
T*
(Step 5: Optional LLM refine step with Gemini.) Tj
T*
(Step 6: Local translation path if LLM is skipped or fails.) Tj
T*
(Step 7: Encode final text into a vibration sequence.) Tj
T*
(Step 8: Simulate or send vibration commands to hardware.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(4. What Result The Project Gives) Tj
T*
(The expected result is:) Tj
T*
(image text -> Tamil text -> vibration sequence for a tactile device.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(In local verification on a sample English image, the pipeline:) Tj
T*
(- read the text successfully,) Tj
T*
(- produced translated output through the offline fallback path,) Tj
T*
(- generated 153 vibration commands,) Tj
T*
(- ran the vibration sequence in terminal simulation mode.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
ET
endstream
endobj
