(So the main project idea works as a prototype.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(5. Does It Work Offline?) Tj
T*
(Answer: Partly yes.) Tj
T*
(- OCR and preprocessing can work offline if Tesseract is installed.) Tj
T*
(- The local fallback dictionary gives a basic offline translation path.) Tj
T*
(- The vibration simulator works offline.) Tj
T*
(- BLE capture is not finished yet.) Tj
T*
(- Real BLE sending code exists, but the main pipeline currently uses simulation.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Offline conclusion:) Tj
T*
(The core demo works offline in a limited way, but full hardware support is not complete.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(6. Does It Work Online?) Tj
T*
(Answer: Partly yes.) Tj
T*
(- A FastAPI backend exists.) Tj
T*
(- API routes such as / and /upload-book are present.) Tj
T*
(- A React frontend dashboard exists.) Tj
T*
(- But the frontend build failed locally because of a Vite/SWC process error.) Tj
T*
(- The online translation library is also not healthy in the current setup.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Online conclusion:) Tj
T*
(The online architecture exists, but it is not fully stable in the current environment.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(7. Is LLM Integrated?) Tj
T*
(Answer: Yes.) Tj
T*
(- The file agents/refine.py integrates Gemini through google.generativeai.) Tj
T*
(- config.py has USE_LLM = True.) Tj
T*
(- The LLM step is placed before the normal translation step.) Tj
T*
(- It is meant to fix OCR mistakes and translate to Tamil.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Current LLM status:) Tj
T*
(- The key in config.py is only a placeholder.) Tj
T*
(- The Gemini package used here is deprecated.) Tj
T*
(- In testing, the LLM step timed out and did not complete successfully.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(LLM conclusion:) Tj
T*
(LLM integration exists in code, but it is not working correctly in the current setup.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(8. Important Problems Found) Tj
T*
(- After local translation, the language state stays as english, so Tamil text is encoded) Tj
T*
(  through the English path. This causes many Tamil characters to fall back to a default buzz) Tj
T*
(  pattern instead of using proper Tamil mapping.) Tj
T*
(- The Gemini key is not configured for real use.) Tj
T*
(- googletrans fails because of a compatibility problem with httpcore.) Tj
T*
(- BLE capture mode is still a stub.) Tj
T*
ET
endstream
